{"format":"amble","version":1,"id":"p1e3z1y2g1f65","title":"Neon Drift","notes":"","mode":"2d","stage":{"id":"t0j084r051n22","kind":"stage","name":"Stage","description":"","costumes":[{"id":"a5i5l6l274q1j","name":"deep space","kind":"image","dataUrl":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","mime":"image/svg+xml","width":480,"height":360,"resolution":1,"centerX":240,"centerY":180}],"sounds":[],"currentCostume":0,"blocks":{"blocks":{"languageVersion":0,"blocks":[{"type":"br_game","id":"b1q6r3c1n4l0j","fields":{"WHAT":"steer a tiny comet through a neon asteroid storm, blast your way through the waves, then defeat the Mothership"},"x":24,"y":24},{"type":"br_audience","id":"b2k0u4l6l595b","fields":{"WHO":"anyone who likes flashy arcade games"},"x":24,"y":122},{"type":"br_style","id":"b4p4p631e5j2m","fields":{"STYLE":"synthwave: deep purple space, a huge striped retro sun sinking into the horizon, a glowing pink and cyan grid racing toward it, bloom and a soft vignette on everything bright"},"x":24,"y":220},{"type":"br_lose","id":"b0x15700r482a","inputs":{"COND":{"block":{"type":"cd_words","id":"b6u2s3t6g6w49","fields":{"TEXT":"the comet has no lives left"}}}},"x":24,"y":318},{"type":"br_win","id":"b2x4w3j3n5s0a","inputs":{"COND":{"block":{"type":"cd_words","id":"b1z6a0d122u6s","fields":{"TEXT":"the Mothership has been destroyed"}}}},"x":24,"y":416},{"type":"ga_rule","id":"b0s101l2p1419","fields":{"RULE":"every 15 seconds a new wave starts: asteroids come faster and more often, and a big glowing \"WAVE 2\" (3, 4...) banner sweeps across the screen with a whoosh"},"x":24,"y":514},{"type":"ga_rule","id":"b326l6x454m2x","fields":{"RULE":"at wave 4 the Mothership arrives from the right: a huge glowing saucer with a health bar at the top of the screen; it drifts up and down, fires slow pink energy orbs at the comet, and flashes white when the laser hits it"},"x":24,"y":612},{"type":"ga_rule","id":"b5c316f3j563c","fields":{"RULE":"now and then a golden star drifts by; catching it sends out an expanding shockwave ring that blasts every asteroid on screen into confetti"},"x":24,"y":710},{"type":"ga_rule","id":"b316o543t4d4x","fields":{"RULE":"the score is the seconds survived plus 50 for every asteroid blasted, shown big and glowing at the top center, with a combo multiplier that grows when you blast asteroids quickly one after another"},"x":24,"y":808},{"type":"ga_rule","id":"b5d3h052t1o46","fields":{"RULE":"a pulsing synthwave bass loop plays as music the whole game"},"x":24,"y":906}]}}},"sprites":[{"id":"t1p006n2a1919","kind":"sprite","name":"Comet","description":"The player: a tiny bright comet.","costumes":[{"id":"a1c6n0w3a0f5h","name":"comet","kind":"image","dataUrl":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","mime":"image/svg+xml","width":64,"height":40,"resolution":1,"centerX":46,"centerY":20}],"sounds":[{"id":"a666n0w5h0f6f","name":"hit","kind":"sound","dataUrl":"data:audio/wav;base64,","mime":"audio/wav","duration":0.14},{"id":"a2s6w3f5o4k0a","name":"powerup","kind":"sound","dataUrl":"data:audio/wav;base64,","mime":"audio/wav","duration":0.46},{"id":"a59543y0f6i1f","name":"laser","kind":"sound","dataUrl":"data:audio/wav;base64,","mime":"audio/wav","duration":0.2}],"currentCostume":0,"blocks":{"blocks":{"languageVersion":0,"blocks":[{"type":"ru_always","id":"b094i3g6u1k0m","x":0,"y":0,"fields":{"RULE":"glide smoothly toward the mouse, tilting the way I move, with a long glowing cyan trail of sparkles behind me"}},{"type":"ga_rule","id":"b04520b0n064v","x":0,"y":172,"fields":{"RULE":"the comet has 3 lives, shown as little glowing hearts at the top right"}},{"type":"ru_never","id":"b4l1s52223d00","x":0,"y":306,"fields":{"RULE":"leave the screen"}},{"type":"ev_key","id":"b695m0x6c011v","x":0,"y":402,"fields":{"KEY":"space"},"next":{"block":{"type":"so_play","id":"b133e286f5d4o","fields":{"SOUND":"laser"},"next":{"block":{"type":"ga_do","id":"b2x1t6n283h6y","fields":{"ACTION":"fire a bright cyan laser bolt straight ahead that shatters the first asteroid it hits into glowing purple rubble"}}}}}},{"type":"ev_click","id":"b345i3f6v5t52","x":0,"y":677,"next":{"block":{"type":"ga_do","id":"b1c272f06604q","fields":{"ACTION":"fire a bright cyan laser bolt straight ahead that shatters the first asteroid it hits into glowing purple rubble"}}}},{"type":"ev_touch","id":"b5o4k3x5g4058","x":0,"y":902,"inputs":{"WHO":{"shadow":{"type":"char_menu","id":"b2p536e4s0o4c","fields":{"NAME":"anyone"}},"block":{"type":"char_ref","id":"b4y550z45643c","fields":{"NAME":"Asteroid"}}}},"next":{"block":{"type":"fl_if","id":"b17601o4c5v5u","inputs":{"COND":{"block":{"type":"cd_words","id":"b3c3e1e2o121p","fields":{"TEXT":"I'm not blinking"}}},"SUBSTACK":{"block":{"type":"so_play","id":"b061z3k465g4w","fields":{"SOUND":"hit"},"next":{"block":{"type":"kit_shake","id":"b0t2h672w056i","next":{"block":{"type":"ga_effect","id":"b633i0h6s3g6p","fields":{"HOW":"a burst of hot pink sparks"},"next":{"block":{"type":"ga_do","id":"b5x2c112o2f1n","fields":{"ACTION":"lose a life, then blink for 1 second (asteroids can't hurt me while I blink)"}}}}}}}}}}}}}]}},"x":-150,"y":0,"z":0,"size":100,"direction":0,"visible":true,"rotationStyle":"all around"},{"id":"t020k3i2j4b0d","kind":"sprite","name":"Asteroid","description":"A spinning space rock with a neon pink rim. The comet can blast it with its laser.","costumes":[{"id":"a4h612h3c1t5j","name":"rock","kind":"image","dataUrl":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","mime":"image/svg+xml","width":60,"height":56,"resolution":1,"centerX":30,"centerY":28}],"sounds":[],"currentCostume":0,"blocks":{"blocks":{"languageVersion":0,"blocks":[{"type":"ev_start","id":"b1s2r64171u2q","next":{"block":{"type":"lo_hide","id":"b4v45581k443t","next":{"block":{"type":"co_forever","id":"b653u3y6w0j6v","inputs":{"SUBSTACK":{"block":{"type":"cp_make","id":"b064j3g6o6347","inputs":{"WHO":{"shadow":{"type":"char_menu","id":"b4w0x0i1t6a2x","fields":{"NAME":"me"}}}},"next":{"block":{"type":"fl_wait","id":"b553k191j2p3d","inputs":{"SECONDS":{"shadow":{"type":"sh_num","id":"b72730r2p4r60","fields":{"NUM":"1"}},"block":{"type":"nm_words","id":"b4t2p1w5u5a3x","fields":{"TEXT":"a little less time each wave, starting at 1 second"}}}}}}}}}}}}},"x":24,"y":24},{"type":"ev_created","id":"b4x2n5y165o40","next":{"block":{"type":"ga_do","id":"b3z5y35715m72","fields":{"ACTION":"start just past the right edge at a random height, with a random size and spin"},"next":{"block":{"type":"lo_show","id":"b5l0g6l5c1763","next":{"block":{"type":"fl_repeat_until","id":"b060o4u3h6m3t","inputs":{"COND":{"block":{"type":"cd_words","id":"b4a5v420l3p2l","fields":{"TEXT":"I'm past the left edge"}}},"SUBSTACK":{"block":{"type":"ga_do","id":"b5u2z2g1h2k0c","fields":{"ACTION":"drift left at this wave's speed, spinning"}}}},"next":{"block":{"type":"co_delete_clone","id":"b3u6b1i0l5t5u"}}}}}}}},"x":24,"y":268}]}},"x":260,"y":0,"z":0,"size":100,"direction":0,"visible":true,"rotationStyle":"all around"}],"variables":[],"compiled":{"createdAt":1793600264057,"model":"gpt-6.1-terra","mode":"2d","inputHash":"54eee2b8","summary":"","howToPlay":"","warnings":[],"code":[{"targetId":"t0j084r051n22","targetName":"Stage","className":"StageScript","source":"// The stage, compiled from its blocks.\nclass StageScript extends Stage {\n  start() {\n    this._script(\"_w697fc02036\", false, \"art style: [synthwave: deep purple space, a huge striped retro sun sinking into the horizon, a glowing pink and cyan grid racing toward it, bloom and a soft vignette on everything bright]\");\n    this._script(\"_wddc080d1c8\", false, \"rule: [every 15 seconds a new wave starts: asteroids come faster and more often, and a big glowing \\\"WAVE 2\\\" (3, 4...) banner sweeps across the screen with a whoosh]\");\n    this._script(\"_w1325ae4c1a\", false, \"rule: [at wave 4 the Mothership arrives from the right: a huge glowing saucer with a health bar at the top of the screen; it drifts up and down, fires slow pink energy orbs at the comet, and flashes white when the laser hits it]\");\n    this._script(\"_w6662bf9d29\", false, \"rule: [now and then a golden star drifts by; catching it sends out an expanding shockwave ring that blasts every asteroid on screen into confetti]\");\n    this._script(\"_w70ae5d5572\", false, \"rule: [the score is the seconds survived plus 50 for every asteroid blasted, shown big and glowing at the top center, with a combo multiplier that grows when you blast asteroids quickly one after another]\");\n    this._script(\"_we7416d361e\", false, \"rule: [a pulsing synthwave bass loop plays as music the whole game]\");\n  }\n  update(dt) {\n    if (this._w43b30c2476()) this.game.over();\n    if (this._w509930793a()) this.game.win();\n  }\n  // art style: [synthwave: deep purple space, a huge striped retro sun sinking into the horizon, a glowing pink and cyan grid racing toward it, bloom and a soft vignette on everything bright]\n  *_w697fc02036() {\n    const scene = this.game.scene;\n    this.game.background = '#170729';\n    const bg = scene.add.graphics().setScrollFactor(0).setDepth(-30);\n    bg.fillGradientStyle(0x180526, 0x27083c, 0x52205e, 0x24103d, 1);\n    bg.fillRect(0, 0, 480, 360);\n    for (let i = 0; i < 65; i++) {\n      bg.fillStyle(i % 3 === 0 ? 0xff75d5 : 0xbceeff, i % 4 === 0 ? 0.8 : 0.4);\n      bg.fillCircle(this.game.random(0, 480), this.game.random(0, 175), i % 9 === 0 ? 1.5 : 0.7);\n    }\n    const cx = 240, cy = 172, radius = 90, horizon = 182;\n    for (let dy = -radius; dy <= radius && cy + dy < horizon; dy += 10) {\n      const half = Math.sqrt(Math.max(0, radius * radius - dy * dy));\n      const t = (dy + radius) / (2 * radius);\n      const color = (255 << 16) | (Math.round(205 - 120 * t) << 8) | Math.round(75 + 120 * t);\n      bg.fillStyle(color, 1);\n      bg.fillRect(cx - half, cy + dy, half * 2, Math.min(7, horizon - cy - dy));\n    }\n    bg.fillGradientStyle(0x30104d, 0x30104d, 0x0b0927, 0x0b0927, 1);\n    bg.fillRect(0, horizon, 480, 360 - horizon);\n    bg.lineStyle(2, 0xff4ecb, 0.9);\n    bg.lineBetween(0, horizon, 480, horizon);\n    const grid = scene.add.graphics().setScrollFactor(0).setDepth(-29);\n    try {\n      const fx = this.game.camera.phaser.postFX;\n      if (fx) {\n        fx.addBloom(0xffcfff, 1, 1, 0.6, 0.55, 4);\n        fx.addVignette(0.5, 0.5, 0.8, 0.35);\n      }\n    } catch (e) {}\n    for (;;) {\n      grid.clear();\n      grid.lineStyle(1, 0x00eaff, 0.6);\n      for (let x = -480; x <= 960; x += 60) grid.lineBetween(240, horizon, x, 360);\n      const phase = (this.game.time * 0.8) % 1;\n      for (let i = 0; i < 10; i++) {\n        const t = (i + phase) / 10;\n        const y = horizon + (360 - horizon) * t * t;\n        grid.lineStyle(1 + t, i % 2 ? 0xff3cbd : 0x00eaff, 0.35 + t * 0.5);\n        grid.lineBetween(0, y, 480, y);\n      }\n      yield;\n    }\n  }\n  // [the comet has no lives left]\n  _w43b30c2476() {\n    return (this.game.vars.lives ?? 3) <= 0;\n  }\n  // [the Mothership has been destroyed]\n  _w509930793a() {\n    return this.game.vars.mothershipDestroyed === true;\n  }\n  // rule: [every 15 seconds a new wave starts: asteroids come faster and more often, and a big glowing \"WAVE 2\" (3, 4...) banner sweeps across the screen with a whoosh]\n  *_wddc080d1c8() {\n    const v = this.game.vars;\n    v.wave ??= 1;\n    for (;;) {\n      const wave = 1 + Math.floor(this.game.time / 15);\n      if (wave > v.wave) {\n        v.wave = wave;\n        this.playSound('wave whoosh');\n        const banner = this.game.scene.add.text(-140, 110, 'WAVE ' + wave, {\n          fontFamily: 'Arial', fontSize: '42px', fontStyle: 'bold', color: '#ffffff',\n          stroke: '#ff18b9', strokeThickness: 5\n        }).setOrigin(0.5).setScrollFactor(0).setDepth(100);\n        banner.setShadow(0, 0, '#00ffff', 16, true, true);\n        this.game.scene.tweens.add({ targets: banner, x: 240, duration: 350, ease: 'Cubic.easeOut' });\n        this.game.scene.tweens.add({ targets: banner, x: 640, alpha: 0, delay: 850, duration: 400, ease: 'Cubic.easeIn', onComplete: () => banner.destroy() });\n      }\n      yield;\n    }\n  }\n  // rule: [at wave 4 the Mothership arrives from the right: a huge glowing saucer with a health bar at the top of the screen; it drifts up and down, fires slow pink energy orbs at the comet, and flashes white when the laser hits it]\n  *_w1325ae4c1a() {\n    const scene = this.game.scene;\n    const label = scene.add.text(240, 48, 'MOTHERSHIP', {\n      fontFamily: 'Arial', fontSize: '12px', fontStyle: 'bold', color: '#ffffff'\n    }).setOrigin(0.5, 0).setScrollFactor(0).setDepth(90).setVisible(false);\n    label.setShadow(0, 0, '#ff44cc', 8, true, true);\n    const bar = scene.add.graphics().setScrollFactor(0).setDepth(90).setVisible(false);\n    let boss = null;\n    for (;;) {\n      if (!boss && (this.game.vars.wave ?? 1) >= 4 && !this.game.vars.mothershipDestroyed) {\n        boss = this.game.spawn('Mothership', { x: 350, y: 0, visible: true });\n        label.setVisible(true);\n        bar.setVisible(true);\n      }\n      if (boss && !boss._dead) {\n        const fraction = Math.max(0, boss.hp / boss.maxHp);\n        bar.clear();\n        bar.fillStyle(0x170b29, 0.9).fillRoundedRect(128, 65, 224, 13, 6);\n        bar.lineStyle(2, 0xff70e5, 1).strokeRoundedRect(128, 65, 224, 13, 6);\n        if (fraction > 0) bar.fillStyle(0xff3bbd, 1).fillRoundedRect(131, 68, 218 * fraction, 7, 3);\n      } else if (boss && boss._dead) {\n        label.setVisible(false);\n        bar.setVisible(false);\n      }\n      yield;\n    }\n  }\n  // rule: [now and then a golden star drifts by; catching it sends out an expanding shockwave ring that blasts every asteroid on screen into confetti]\n  *_w6662bf9d29() {\n    this._shockwaveAt = (x, y) => {\n      const game = this.game;\n      game.effects.burst({ x, y, color: 0xffdf55, count: 25, speed: 180, size: 5, lifetime: 0.6 });\n      this.run(function* () {\n        const ring = game.scene.add.graphics().setDepth(40);\n        const start = game.time;\n        const maxRadius = Math.hypot(240 + Math.abs(x), 180 + Math.abs(y)) + 10;\n        while (game.time - start < 0.65) {\n          const t = Math.min(1, (game.time - start) / 0.65);\n          const r = maxRadius * t;\n          ring.clear();\n          ring.lineStyle(12, 0xffd83d, 0.2 * (1 - t)).strokeCircle(x + 240, 180 - y, r);\n          ring.lineStyle(3, 0xffffb0, 1 - t).strokeCircle(x + 240, 180 - y, r);\n          yield;\n        }\n        ring.destroy();\n      });\n      for (const rock of game.findAll('Asteroid').slice()) {\n        const r = 35 * (rock.size / 100);\n        if (rock.isClone && rock.visible && rock.x + r >= -240 && rock.x - r <= 240 && rock.y + r >= -180 && rock.y - r <= 180) {\n          this._blastAsteroid(rock, 'confetti');\n        }\n      }\n    };\n    yield* this.wait(10);\n    for (;;) {\n      this.game.spawn('GoldenStar', { x: 275, y: this.game.random(-130, 130), visible: true });\n      yield* this.wait(this.game.random(17, 24));\n    }\n  }\n  // rule: [the score is the seconds survived plus 50 for every asteroid blasted, shown big and glowing at the top center, with a combo multiplier that grows when you blast asteroids quickly one after another]\n  *_w70ae5d5572() {\n    const game = this.game, v = game.vars, scene = game.scene;\n    v.blastScore ??= 0;\n    v.asteroidsBlasted ??= 0;\n    v.combo ??= 0;\n    v.lastBlastAt ??= -1000;\n    this._blastAsteroid = (rock, style = 'rubble') => {\n      if (!rock || !rock.isClone || !rock.visible || rock._blasted) return;\n      rock._blasted = true;\n      v.combo = game.time - v.lastBlastAt <= 2 ? Math.min(8, v.combo + 1) : 1;\n      v.lastBlastAt = game.time;\n      v.asteroidsBlasted++;\n      v.blastScore += 50 * v.combo;\n      const x = rock.x, y = rock.y;\n      game.effects.burst({ x, y, color: style === 'confetti' ? 0xffdc55 : 0xc13aff, count: 15, speed: 160, size: 4, lifetime: 0.5 });\n      const colors = style === 'confetti' ? [0xffdd44, 0xff54c8, 0x44eeff, 0xc55aff] : [0x8731c9, 0xc65aff, 0xff5aca];\n      for (let i = 0; i < 8; i++) {\n        const bit = scene.add.rectangle(x + 240, 180 - y, game.random(3, 8), game.random(3, 8), colors[i % colors.length]).setDepth(25);\n        scene.tweens.add({ targets: bit, x: bit.x + game.random(-100, 100), y: bit.y + game.random(-100, 80), angle: game.random(-220, 220), alpha: 0, duration: game.random(400, 700), onComplete: () => bit.destroy() });\n      }\n      rock.destroy();\n    };\n    const score = scene.add.text(240, 8, '', { fontFamily: 'Arial', fontSize: '23px', fontStyle: 'bold', color: '#ffffff', stroke: '#6b1a9c', strokeThickness: 3 }).setOrigin(0.5, 0).setScrollFactor(0).setDepth(90);\n    score.setShadow(0, 0, '#00ffff', 12, true, true);\n    const combo = scene.add.text(240, 34, '', { fontFamily: 'Arial', fontSize: '14px', fontStyle: 'bold', color: '#ff75e6' }).setOrigin(0.5, 0).setScrollFactor(0).setDepth(90);\n    combo.setShadow(0, 0, '#ff00cc', 8, true, true);\n    for (;;) {\n      if (game.time - v.lastBlastAt > 2) v.combo = 0;\n      v.score = Math.floor(game.time) + v.blastScore;\n      score.setText('SCORE ' + v.score);\n      combo.setText(v.combo > 1 ? 'COMBO x' + v.combo : '');\n      yield;\n    }\n  }\n  // rule: [a pulsing synthwave bass loop plays as music the whole game]\n  *_we7416d361e() {\n    this.game.music('synthwave bass loop');\n  }\n}","runSource":"// The stage, compiled from its blocks.\nclass StageScript extends Stage {\n  start() {\n    this._script(\"_w697fc02036\", false, \"art style: [synthwave: deep purple space, a huge striped retro sun sinking into the horizon, a glowing pink and cyan grid racing toward it, bloom and a soft vignette on everything bright]\");\n    this._script(\"_wddc080d1c8\", false, \"rule: [every 15 seconds a new wave starts: asteroids come faster and more often, and a big glowing \\\"WAVE 2\\\" (3, 4...) banner sweeps across the screen with a whoosh]\");\n    this._script(\"_w1325ae4c1a\", false, \"rule: [at wave 4 the Mothership arrives from the right: a huge glowing saucer with a health bar at the top of the screen; it drifts up and down, fires slow pink energy orbs at the comet, and flashes white when the laser hits it]\");\n    this._script(\"_w6662bf9d29\", false, \"rule: [now and then a golden star drifts by; catching it sends out an expanding shockwave ring that blasts every asteroid on screen into confetti]\");\n    this._script(\"_w70ae5d5572\", false, \"rule: [the score is the seconds survived plus 50 for every asteroid blasted, shown big and glowing at the top center, with a combo multiplier that grows when you blast asteroids quickly one after another]\");\n    this._script(\"_we7416d361e\", false, \"rule: [a pulsing synthwave bass loop plays as music the whole game]\");\n  }\n  update(dt) {\n    if (this._w43b30c2476()) this.game.over();\n    if (this._w509930793a()) this.game.win();\n  }\n  // art style: [synthwave: deep purple space, a huge striped retro sun sinking into the horizon, a glowing pink and cyan grid racing toward it, bloom and a soft vignette on everything bright]\n  *_w697fc02036() {\n    const scene = this.game.scene;\n    this.game.background = '#170729';\n    const bg = scene.add.graphics().setScrollFactor(0).setDepth(-30);\n    bg.fillGradientStyle(0x180526, 0x27083c, 0x52205e, 0x24103d, 1);\n    bg.fillRect(0, 0, 480, 360);\n    for (let i = 0; i < 65; i++) { if (__ambleGuardYield()) yield; \n      bg.fillStyle(i % 3 === 0 ? 0xff75d5 : 0xbceeff, i % 4 === 0 ? 0.8 : 0.4);\n      bg.fillCircle(this.game.random(0, 480), this.game.random(0, 175), i % 9 === 0 ? 1.5 : 0.7);\n    }\n    const cx = 240, cy = 172, radius = 90, horizon = 182;\n    for (let dy = -radius; dy <= radius && cy + dy < horizon; dy += 10) { if (__ambleGuardYield()) yield; \n      const half = Math.sqrt(Math.max(0, radius * radius - dy * dy));\n      const t = (dy + radius) / (2 * radius);\n      const color = (255 << 16) | (Math.round(205 - 120 * t) << 8) | Math.round(75 + 120 * t);\n      bg.fillStyle(color, 1);\n      bg.fillRect(cx - half, cy + dy, half * 2, Math.min(7, horizon - cy - dy));\n    }\n    bg.fillGradientStyle(0x30104d, 0x30104d, 0x0b0927, 0x0b0927, 1);\n    bg.fillRect(0, horizon, 480, 360 - horizon);\n    bg.lineStyle(2, 0xff4ecb, 0.9);\n    bg.lineBetween(0, horizon, 480, horizon);\n    const grid = scene.add.graphics().setScrollFactor(0).setDepth(-29);\n    try {\n      const fx = this.game.camera.phaser.postFX;\n      if (fx) {\n        fx.addBloom(0xffcfff, 1, 1, 0.6, 0.55, 4);\n        fx.addVignette(0.5, 0.5, 0.8, 0.35);\n      }\n    } catch (e) {}\n    for (;;) { if (__ambleGuardYield()) yield; \n      grid.clear();\n      grid.lineStyle(1, 0x00eaff, 0.6);\n      for (let x = -480; x <= 960; x += 60) { if (__ambleGuardYield()) yield; grid.lineBetween(240, horizon, x, 360); }\n      const phase = (this.game.time * 0.8) % 1;\n      for (let i = 0; i < 10; i++) { if (__ambleGuardYield()) yield; \n        const t = (i + phase) / 10;\n        const y = horizon + (360 - horizon) * t * t;\n        grid.lineStyle(1 + t, i % 2 ? 0xff3cbd : 0x00eaff, 0.35 + t * 0.5);\n        grid.lineBetween(0, y, 480, y);\n      }\n      yield;\n    }\n  }\n  // [the comet has no lives left]\n  _w43b30c2476() {\n    return (this.game.vars.lives ?? 3) <= 0;\n  }\n  // [the Mothership has been destroyed]\n  _w509930793a() {\n    return this.game.vars.mothershipDestroyed === true;\n  }\n  // rule: [every 15 seconds a new wave starts: asteroids come faster and more often, and a big glowing \"WAVE 2\" (3, 4...) banner sweeps across the screen with a whoosh]\n  *_wddc080d1c8() {\n    const v = this.game.vars;\n    v.wave ??= 1;\n    for (;;) { if (__ambleGuardYield()) yield; \n      const wave = 1 + Math.floor(this.game.time / 15);\n      if (wave > v.wave) {\n        v.wave = wave;\n        this.playSound('wave whoosh');\n        const banner = this.game.scene.add.text(-140, 110, 'WAVE ' + wave, {\n          fontFamily: 'Arial', fontSize: '42px', fontStyle: 'bold', color: '#ffffff',\n          stroke: '#ff18b9', strokeThickness: 5\n        }).setOrigin(0.5).setScrollFactor(0).setDepth(100);\n        banner.setShadow(0, 0, '#00ffff', 16, true, true);\n        this.game.scene.tweens.add({ targets: banner, x: 240, duration: 350, ease: 'Cubic.easeOut' });\n        this.game.scene.tweens.add({ targets: banner, x: 640, alpha: 0, delay: 850, duration: 400, ease: 'Cubic.easeIn', onComplete: () => banner.destroy() });\n      }\n      yield;\n    }\n  }\n  // rule: [at wave 4 the Mothership arrives from the right: a huge glowing saucer with a health bar at the top of the screen; it drifts up and down, fires slow pink energy orbs at the comet, and flashes white when the laser hits it]\n  *_w1325ae4c1a() {\n    const scene = this.game.scene;\n    const label = scene.add.text(240, 48, 'MOTHERSHIP', {\n      fontFamily: 'Arial', fontSize: '12px', fontStyle: 'bold', color: '#ffffff'\n    }).setOrigin(0.5, 0).setScrollFactor(0).setDepth(90).setVisible(false);\n    label.setShadow(0, 0, '#ff44cc', 8, true, true);\n    const bar = scene.add.graphics().setScrollFactor(0).setDepth(90).setVisible(false);\n    let boss = null;\n    for (;;) { if (__ambleGuardYield()) yield; \n      if (!boss && (this.game.vars.wave ?? 1) >= 4 && !this.game.vars.mothershipDestroyed) {\n        boss = this.game.spawn('Mothership', { x: 350, y: 0, visible: true });\n        label.setVisible(true);\n        bar.setVisible(true);\n      }\n      if (boss && !boss._dead) {\n        const fraction = Math.max(0, boss.hp / boss.maxHp);\n        bar.clear();\n        bar.fillStyle(0x170b29, 0.9).fillRoundedRect(128, 65, 224, 13, 6);\n        bar.lineStyle(2, 0xff70e5, 1).strokeRoundedRect(128, 65, 224, 13, 6);\n        if (fraction > 0) bar.fillStyle(0xff3bbd, 1).fillRoundedRect(131, 68, 218 * fraction, 7, 3);\n      } else if (boss && boss._dead) {\n        label.setVisible(false);\n        bar.setVisible(false);\n      }\n      yield;\n    }\n  }\n  // rule: [now and then a golden star drifts by; catching it sends out an expanding shockwave ring that blasts every asteroid on screen into confetti]\n  *_w6662bf9d29() {\n    this._shockwaveAt = (x, y) => {\n      const game = this.game;\n      game.effects.burst({ x, y, color: 0xffdf55, count: 25, speed: 180, size: 5, lifetime: 0.6 });\n      this.run(function* () {\n        const ring = game.scene.add.graphics().setDepth(40);\n        const start = game.time;\n        const maxRadius = Math.hypot(240 + Math.abs(x), 180 + Math.abs(y)) + 10;\n        while (game.time - start < 0.65) { if (__ambleGuardYield()) yield; \n          const t = Math.min(1, (game.time - start) / 0.65);\n          const r = maxRadius * t;\n          ring.clear();\n          ring.lineStyle(12, 0xffd83d, 0.2 * (1 - t)).strokeCircle(x + 240, 180 - y, r);\n          ring.lineStyle(3, 0xffffb0, 1 - t).strokeCircle(x + 240, 180 - y, r);\n          yield;\n        }\n        ring.destroy();\n      });\n      for (const rock of game.findAll('Asteroid').slice()) { __ambleGuardThrow(); \n        const r = 35 * (rock.size / 100);\n        if (rock.isClone && rock.visible && rock.x + r >= -240 && rock.x - r <= 240 && rock.y + r >= -180 && rock.y - r <= 180) {\n          this._blastAsteroid(rock, 'confetti');\n        }\n      }\n    };\n    yield* this.wait(10);\n    for (;;) { if (__ambleGuardYield()) yield; \n      this.game.spawn('GoldenStar', { x: 275, y: this.game.random(-130, 130), visible: true });\n      yield* this.wait(this.game.random(17, 24));\n    }\n  }\n  // rule: [the score is the seconds survived plus 50 for every asteroid blasted, shown big and glowing at the top center, with a combo multiplier that grows when you blast asteroids quickly one after another]\n  *_w70ae5d5572() {\n    const game = this.game, v = game.vars, scene = game.scene;\n    v.blastScore ??= 0;\n    v.asteroidsBlasted ??= 0;\n    v.combo ??= 0;\n    v.lastBlastAt ??= -1000;\n    this._blastAsteroid = (rock, style = 'rubble') => {\n      if (!rock || !rock.isClone || !rock.visible || rock._blasted) return;\n      rock._blasted = true;\n      v.combo = game.time - v.lastBlastAt <= 2 ? Math.min(8, v.combo + 1) : 1;\n      v.lastBlastAt = game.time;\n      v.asteroidsBlasted++;\n      v.blastScore += 50 * v.combo;\n      const x = rock.x, y = rock.y;\n      game.effects.burst({ x, y, color: style === 'confetti' ? 0xffdc55 : 0xc13aff, count: 15, speed: 160, size: 4, lifetime: 0.5 });\n      const colors = style === 'confetti' ? [0xffdd44, 0xff54c8, 0x44eeff, 0xc55aff] : [0x8731c9, 0xc65aff, 0xff5aca];\n      for (let i = 0; i < 8; i++) { __ambleGuardThrow(); \n        const bit = scene.add.rectangle(x + 240, 180 - y, game.random(3, 8), game.random(3, 8), colors[i % colors.length]).setDepth(25);\n        scene.tweens.add({ targets: bit, x: bit.x + game.random(-100, 100), y: bit.y + game.random(-100, 80), angle: game.random(-220, 220), alpha: 0, duration: game.random(400, 700), onComplete: () => bit.destroy() });\n      }\n      rock.destroy();\n    };\n    const score = scene.add.text(240, 8, '', { fontFamily: 'Arial', fontSize: '23px', fontStyle: 'bold', color: '#ffffff', stroke: '#6b1a9c', strokeThickness: 3 }).setOrigin(0.5, 0).setScrollFactor(0).setDepth(90);\n    score.setShadow(0, 0, '#00ffff', 12, true, true);\n    const combo = scene.add.text(240, 34, '', { fontFamily: 'Arial', fontSize: '14px', fontStyle: 'bold', color: '#ff75e6' }).setOrigin(0.5, 0).setScrollFactor(0).setDepth(90);\n    combo.setShadow(0, 0, '#ff00cc', 8, true, true);\n    for (;;) { if (__ambleGuardYield()) yield; \n      if (game.time - v.lastBlastAt > 2) v.combo = 0;\n      v.score = Math.floor(game.time) + v.blastScore;\n      score.setText('SCORE ' + v.score);\n      combo.setText(v.combo > 1 ? 'COMBO x' + v.combo : '');\n      yield;\n    }\n  }\n  // rule: [a pulsing synthwave bass loop plays as music the whole game]\n  *_we7416d361e() {\n    this.game.music('synthwave bass loop');\n  }\n}"},{"targetId":"t1p006n2a1919","targetName":"Comet","className":"Comet","source":"// Comet, compiled from its blocks.\nclass Comet extends Sprite {\n  start() {\n    this._script(\"_weff8919a44\", false, \"always: [glide smoothly toward the mouse, tilting the way I move, with a long glowing cyan trail of sparkles behind me]\");\n    this._script(\"_w4ad4138e36\", false, \"rule: [the comet has 3 lives, shown as little glowing hearts at the top right]\");\n    this._script(\"_wa87452cc42\", false, \"never: [leave the screen]\");\n  }\n  onSpawn() {\n    this._script(\"_weff8919a44\", false, \"always: [glide smoothly toward the mouse, tilting the way I move, with a long glowing cyan trail of sparkles behind me]\");\n    this._script(\"_wa87452cc42\", false, \"never: [leave the screen]\");\n  }\n  onKeyDown(key) {\n    if (key === \"space\") this._script(\"_s1\", false, \"when [space ▾] key pressed\");\n  }\n  onClick() {\n    this._script(\"_s2\", true, \"when I'm clicked\");\n  }\n  update(dt) {\n    { const now = !!this.touching(\"Asteroid\"); if (now && !this._e1) this._script(\"_s3\", false, \"when I touch (Asteroid)\"); this._e1 = now; }\n  }\n  // when [space ▾] key pressed\n  *_s1() {\n    this.playSound(\"laser\");\n    yield* this._w50cb85e2ec();\n  }\n  // when I'm clicked\n  *_s2() {\n    yield* this._w50cb85e2ec();\n  }\n  // when I touch (Asteroid)\n  *_s3() {\n    if (this._w5f1e348094()) {\n      this.playSound(\"hit\");\n      this.game.camera.shake(8, 0.3);\n      yield* this._wa48bfe633b();\n      yield* this._w9faed7583a();\n    }\n  }\n  // always: [glide smoothly toward the mouse, tilting the way I move, with a long glowing cyan trail of sparkles behind me]\n  *_weff8919a44() {\n    try {\n      if (this.image.postFX) this.image.postFX.addGlow(0x40f8ff, 3);\n    } catch (e) {}\n    this.game.scene.add.particles(0, 0, 'amble-dot', {\n      follow: this.image, frequency: 25, lifespan: { min: 600, max: 1000 },\n      speedX: { min: -100, max: -35 }, speedY: { min: -22, max: 22 },\n      scale: { start: 0.35, end: 0 }, alpha: { start: 0.85, end: 0 },\n      tint: [0x44ffff, 0x88ddff, 0xffffff], blendMode: 'ADD'\n    }).setDepth((this.layer ?? 0) - 0.1);\n    for (;;) {\n      const mouse = this.game.input.mouse;\n      const tx = Math.max(-208, Math.min(208, mouse.x));\n      const ty = Math.max(-160, Math.min(160, mouse.y));\n      const dx = tx - this.x, dy = ty - this.y;\n      const amount = 1 - Math.exp(-7 * this.game.dt);\n      this.x += dx * amount;\n      this.y += dy * amount;\n      const tilt = Math.hypot(dx, dy) < 1 ? 0 : Math.max(-35, Math.min(35, Math.atan2(dy, Math.max(40, Math.abs(dx))) * 180 / Math.PI));\n      this.angle += (tilt - this.angle) * (1 - Math.exp(-10 * this.game.dt));\n      yield;\n    }\n  }\n  // rule: [the comet has 3 lives, shown as little glowing hearts at the top right]\n  *_w4ad4138e36() {\n    const v = this.game.vars;\n    v.lives ??= 3;\n    this._invulnerableUntil ??= 0;\n    this._startDamage = () => {\n      if (this.game.time < this._invulnerableUntil || (v.lives ?? 3) <= 0) return false;\n      this._invulnerableUntil = this.game.time + 1;\n      v.lives = Math.max(0, (v.lives ?? 3) - 1);\n      return true;\n    };\n    const hearts = this.game.scene.add.text(470, 10, '', {\n      fontFamily: 'Arial', fontSize: '22px', fontStyle: 'bold', color: '#ff70ca'\n    }).setOrigin(1, 0).setScrollFactor(0).setDepth(90);\n    hearts.setShadow(0, 0, '#ff149f', 10, true, true);\n    for (;;) {\n      hearts.setText('♥ '.repeat(Math.max(0, v.lives)).trim());\n      this.opacity = this.game.time < this._invulnerableUntil && Math.floor(this.game.time * 12) % 2 === 0 ? 0.22 : 1;\n      yield;\n    }\n  }\n  // never: [leave the screen]\n  *_wa87452cc42() {\n    for (;;) {\n      this.keepOnStage();\n      yield;\n    }\n  }\n  // do [fire a bright cyan laser bolt straight ahead that shatters the first asteroid it hits into glowing purple rubble]\n  *_w50cb85e2ec() {\n    const a = this.angle * Math.PI / 180;\n    this.game.spawn('LaserBolt', {\n      x: this.x + 30 * Math.cos(a), y: this.y + 30 * Math.sin(a),\n      angle: this.angle, visible: true\n    });\n  }\n  // [I'm not blinking]\n  _w5f1e348094() {\n    return this.game.time >= (this._invulnerableUntil ?? 0);\n  }\n  // particles: [a burst of hot pink sparks]\n  *_wa48bfe633b() {\n    this.game.effects.burst({ x: this.x, y: this.y, color: 0xff149f, count: 24, speed: 190, size: 5, lifetime: 0.5 });\n  }\n  // do [lose a life, then blink for 1 second (asteroids can't hurt me while I blink)]\n  *_w9faed7583a() {\n    if (!this._startDamage()) return;\n    yield* this.wait(1);\n  }\n}","runSource":"// Comet, compiled from its blocks.\nclass Comet extends Sprite {\n  start() {\n    this._script(\"_weff8919a44\", false, \"always: [glide smoothly toward the mouse, tilting the way I move, with a long glowing cyan trail of sparkles behind me]\");\n    this._script(\"_w4ad4138e36\", false, \"rule: [the comet has 3 lives, shown as little glowing hearts at the top right]\");\n    this._script(\"_wa87452cc42\", false, \"never: [leave the screen]\");\n  }\n  onSpawn() {\n    this._script(\"_weff8919a44\", false, \"always: [glide smoothly toward the mouse, tilting the way I move, with a long glowing cyan trail of sparkles behind me]\");\n    this._script(\"_wa87452cc42\", false, \"never: [leave the screen]\");\n  }\n  onKeyDown(key) {\n    if (key === \"space\") this._script(\"_s1\", false, \"when [space ▾] key pressed\");\n  }\n  onClick() {\n    this._script(\"_s2\", true, \"when I'm clicked\");\n  }\n  update(dt) {\n    { const now = !!this.touching(\"Asteroid\"); if (now && !this._e1) this._script(\"_s3\", false, \"when I touch (Asteroid)\"); this._e1 = now; }\n  }\n  // when [space ▾] key pressed\n  *_s1() {\n    this.playSound(\"laser\");\n    yield* this._w50cb85e2ec();\n  }\n  // when I'm clicked\n  *_s2() {\n    yield* this._w50cb85e2ec();\n  }\n  // when I touch (Asteroid)\n  *_s3() {\n    if (this._w5f1e348094()) {\n      this.playSound(\"hit\");\n      this.game.camera.shake(8, 0.3);\n      yield* this._wa48bfe633b();\n      yield* this._w9faed7583a();\n    }\n  }\n  // always: [glide smoothly toward the mouse, tilting the way I move, with a long glowing cyan trail of sparkles behind me]\n  *_weff8919a44() {\n    try {\n      if (this.image.postFX) this.image.postFX.addGlow(0x40f8ff, 3);\n    } catch (e) {}\n    this.game.scene.add.particles(0, 0, 'amble-dot', {\n      follow: this.image, frequency: 25, lifespan: { min: 600, max: 1000 },\n      speedX: { min: -100, max: -35 }, speedY: { min: -22, max: 22 },\n      scale: { start: 0.35, end: 0 }, alpha: { start: 0.85, end: 0 },\n      tint: [0x44ffff, 0x88ddff, 0xffffff], blendMode: 'ADD'\n    }).setDepth((this.layer ?? 0) - 0.1);\n    for (;;) { if (__ambleGuardYield()) yield; \n      const mouse = this.game.input.mouse;\n      const tx = Math.max(-208, Math.min(208, mouse.x));\n      const ty = Math.max(-160, Math.min(160, mouse.y));\n      const dx = tx - this.x, dy = ty - this.y;\n      const amount = 1 - Math.exp(-7 * this.game.dt);\n      this.x += dx * amount;\n      this.y += dy * amount;\n      const tilt = Math.hypot(dx, dy) < 1 ? 0 : Math.max(-35, Math.min(35, Math.atan2(dy, Math.max(40, Math.abs(dx))) * 180 / Math.PI));\n      this.angle += (tilt - this.angle) * (1 - Math.exp(-10 * this.game.dt));\n      yield;\n    }\n  }\n  // rule: [the comet has 3 lives, shown as little glowing hearts at the top right]\n  *_w4ad4138e36() {\n    const v = this.game.vars;\n    v.lives ??= 3;\n    this._invulnerableUntil ??= 0;\n    this._startDamage = () => {\n      if (this.game.time < this._invulnerableUntil || (v.lives ?? 3) <= 0) return false;\n      this._invulnerableUntil = this.game.time + 1;\n      v.lives = Math.max(0, (v.lives ?? 3) - 1);\n      return true;\n    };\n    const hearts = this.game.scene.add.text(470, 10, '', {\n      fontFamily: 'Arial', fontSize: '22px', fontStyle: 'bold', color: '#ff70ca'\n    }).setOrigin(1, 0).setScrollFactor(0).setDepth(90);\n    hearts.setShadow(0, 0, '#ff149f', 10, true, true);\n    for (;;) { if (__ambleGuardYield()) yield; \n      hearts.setText('♥ '.repeat(Math.max(0, v.lives)).trim());\n      this.opacity = this.game.time < this._invulnerableUntil && Math.floor(this.game.time * 12) % 2 === 0 ? 0.22 : 1;\n      yield;\n    }\n  }\n  // never: [leave the screen]\n  *_wa87452cc42() {\n    for (;;) { if (__ambleGuardYield()) yield; \n      this.keepOnStage();\n      yield;\n    }\n  }\n  // do [fire a bright cyan laser bolt straight ahead that shatters the first asteroid it hits into glowing purple rubble]\n  *_w50cb85e2ec() {\n    const a = this.angle * Math.PI / 180;\n    this.game.spawn('LaserBolt', {\n      x: this.x + 30 * Math.cos(a), y: this.y + 30 * Math.sin(a),\n      angle: this.angle, visible: true\n    });\n  }\n  // [I'm not blinking]\n  _w5f1e348094() {\n    return this.game.time >= (this._invulnerableUntil ?? 0);\n  }\n  // particles: [a burst of hot pink sparks]\n  *_wa48bfe633b() {\n    this.game.effects.burst({ x: this.x, y: this.y, color: 0xff149f, count: 24, speed: 190, size: 5, lifetime: 0.5 });\n  }\n  // do [lose a life, then blink for 1 second (asteroids can't hurt me while I blink)]\n  *_w9faed7583a() {\n    if (!this._startDamage()) return;\n    yield* this.wait(1);\n  }\n}"},{"targetId":"t020k3i2j4b0d","targetName":"Asteroid","className":"Asteroid","source":"// Asteroid, compiled from its blocks.\nclass Asteroid extends Sprite {\n  start() {\n    this._script(\"_s1\", true, \"when ⚑ clicked\");\n  }\n  onSpawn() {\n    this._script(\"_s2\", false, \"when I'm created as a copy\");\n  }\n  // when ⚑ clicked\n  *_s1() {\n    this.hide();\n    for (;;) {\n      this.clone();\n      yield* this.wait((Number(this._w20f2bfbd50()) || 0));\n      yield;\n    }\n  }\n  // when I'm created as a copy\n  *_s2() {\n    yield* this._wf3cdb5855f();\n    this.show();\n    while (!(this._w5db7e1d1f6())) {\n      yield* this._wb88fd29394();\n      yield;\n    }\n    if (this.isClone) { this.destroy(); return; }\n  }\n  // [a little less time each wave, starting at 1 second]\n  _w20f2bfbd50() {\n    return Math.max(0.28, 1 - 0.12 * ((this.game.vars.wave ?? 1) - 1));\n  }\n  // do [start just past the right edge at a random height, with a random size and spin]\n  *_wf3cdb5855f() {\n    this.size = this.game.random(65, 125);\n    this.setPosition(248 + 35 * this.size / 100, this.game.random(-150, 150));\n    this.angle = this.game.random(0, 359);\n    this._spinSpeed = this.game.random(-160, 160);\n    if (Math.abs(this._spinSpeed) < 35) this._spinSpeed = 60;\n  }\n  // [I'm past the left edge]\n  _w5db7e1d1f6() {\n    return this.x < -240 - 35 * this.size / 100;\n  }\n  // do [drift left at this wave's speed, spinning]\n  *_wb88fd29394() {\n    const speed = Math.min(300, 115 + 35 * ((this.game.vars.wave ?? 1) - 1));\n    this.x -= speed * this.game.dt;\n    this.angle += (this._spinSpeed ?? 60) * this.game.dt;\n  }\n}","runSource":"// Asteroid, compiled from its blocks.\nclass Asteroid extends Sprite {\n  start() {\n    this._script(\"_s1\", true, \"when ⚑ clicked\");\n  }\n  onSpawn() {\n    this._script(\"_s2\", false, \"when I'm created as a copy\");\n  }\n  // when ⚑ clicked\n  *_s1() {\n    this.hide();\n    for (;;) { if (__ambleGuardYield()) yield; \n      this.clone();\n      yield* this.wait((Number(this._w20f2bfbd50()) || 0));\n      yield;\n    }\n  }\n  // when I'm created as a copy\n  *_s2() {\n    yield* this._wf3cdb5855f();\n    this.show();\n    while (!(this._w5db7e1d1f6())) { if (__ambleGuardYield()) yield; \n      yield* this._wb88fd29394();\n      yield;\n    }\n    if (this.isClone) { this.destroy(); return; }\n  }\n  // [a little less time each wave, starting at 1 second]\n  _w20f2bfbd50() {\n    return Math.max(0.28, 1 - 0.12 * ((this.game.vars.wave ?? 1) - 1));\n  }\n  // do [start just past the right edge at a random height, with a random size and spin]\n  *_wf3cdb5855f() {\n    this.size = this.game.random(65, 125);\n    this.setPosition(248 + 35 * this.size / 100, this.game.random(-150, 150));\n    this.angle = this.game.random(0, 359);\n    this._spinSpeed = this.game.random(-160, 160);\n    if (Math.abs(this._spinSpeed) < 35) this._spinSpeed = 60;\n  }\n  // [I'm past the left edge]\n  _w5db7e1d1f6() {\n    return this.x < -240 - 35 * this.size / 100;\n  }\n  // do [drift left at this wave's speed, spinning]\n  *_wb88fd29394() {\n    const speed = Math.min(300, 115 + 35 * ((this.game.vars.wave ?? 1) - 1));\n    this.x -= speed * this.game.dt;\n    this.angle += (this._spinSpeed ?? 60) * this.game.dt;\n  }\n}"},{"targetId":"s4p0y0u410e0k","targetName":"LaserBolt","className":"LaserBolt","source":"class LaserBolt extends Sprite {\n  start() { this.hide(); }\n  onSpawn() {\n    this.show();\n    const a = this.angle * Math.PI / 180;\n    this._vx = 650 * Math.cos(a);\n    this._vy = 650 * Math.sin(a);\n    try { if (this.image.postFX) this.image.postFX.addGlow(0x44ffff, 3); } catch (e) {}\n  }\n  update(dt) {\n    if (!this.isClone) return;\n    this.x += this._vx * dt;\n    this.y += this._vy * dt;\n    const rock = this.touching('Asteroid');\n    if (rock) {\n      this.game.stage._blastAsteroid(rock, 'rubble');\n      this.destroy();\n      return;\n    }\n    const boss = this.touching('Mothership');\n    if (boss && !boss._dead) {\n      boss.hitByLaser();\n      this.destroy();\n      return;\n    }\n    if (this.x < -280 || this.x > 280 || this.y < -220 || this.y > 220) this.destroy();\n  }\n}","runSource":"class LaserBolt extends Sprite {\n  start() { this.hide(); }\n  onSpawn() {\n    this.show();\n    const a = this.angle * Math.PI / 180;\n    this._vx = 650 * Math.cos(a);\n    this._vy = 650 * Math.sin(a);\n    try { if (this.image.postFX) this.image.postFX.addGlow(0x44ffff, 3); } catch (e) {}\n  }\n  update(dt) {\n    if (!this.isClone) return;\n    this.x += this._vx * dt;\n    this.y += this._vy * dt;\n    const rock = this.touching('Asteroid');\n    if (rock) {\n      this.game.stage._blastAsteroid(rock, 'rubble');\n      this.destroy();\n      return;\n    }\n    const boss = this.touching('Mothership');\n    if (boss && !boss._dead) {\n      boss.hitByLaser();\n      this.destroy();\n      return;\n    }\n    if (this.x < -280 || this.x > 280 || this.y < -220 || this.y > 220) this.destroy();\n  }\n}"},{"targetId":"s084e6g4f2d5l","targetName":"Mothership","className":"Mothership","source":"class Mothership extends Sprite {\n  start() { this.hide(); }\n  onSpawn() {\n    this.show();\n    this.maxHp = 14;\n    this.hp = this.maxHp;\n    this._dead = false;\n    this._flashUntil = 0;\n    this._nextOrbTime = this.game.time + 2;\n    try { if (this.image.postFX) this.image.postFX.addGlow(0xff41cf, 4); } catch (e) {}\n  }\n  hitByLaser() {\n    if (this._dead) return;\n    this.hp--;\n    this._flashUntil = this.game.time + 0.12;\n    this.image.setTintFill(0xffffff);\n    this.game.effects.burst({ x: this.x - 60, y: this.y, color: 0x8cffff, count: 9, speed: 100, size: 3, lifetime: 0.3 });\n    if (this.hp <= 0) {\n      this._dead = true;\n      this.game.vars.mothershipDestroyed = true;\n      this.game.effects.burst({ x: this.x, y: this.y, color: 0xff56de, count: 60, speed: 250, size: 7, lifetime: 1 });\n      this.game.camera.shake(0.012, 0.4);\n      this.destroy();\n    }\n  }\n  update(dt) {\n    if (!this.isClone || this._dead) return;\n    this.x = Math.max(132, this.x - 145 * dt);\n    this.y = 70 * Math.sin(this.game.time * 0.8);\n    if (this._flashUntil && this.game.time >= this._flashUntil) {\n      this.image.clearTint();\n      this._flashUntil = 0;\n    }\n    if (this.x <= 200 && this.game.time >= this._nextOrbTime) {\n      this.game.spawn('EnergyOrb', { x: this.x - 88, y: this.y, visible: true });\n      this._nextOrbTime = this.game.time + 2.2;\n    }\n  }\n}","runSource":"class Mothership extends Sprite {\n  start() { this.hide(); }\n  onSpawn() {\n    this.show();\n    this.maxHp = 14;\n    this.hp = this.maxHp;\n    this._dead = false;\n    this._flashUntil = 0;\n    this._nextOrbTime = this.game.time + 2;\n    try { if (this.image.postFX) this.image.postFX.addGlow(0xff41cf, 4); } catch (e) {}\n  }\n  hitByLaser() {\n    if (this._dead) return;\n    this.hp--;\n    this._flashUntil = this.game.time + 0.12;\n    this.image.setTintFill(0xffffff);\n    this.game.effects.burst({ x: this.x - 60, y: this.y, color: 0x8cffff, count: 9, speed: 100, size: 3, lifetime: 0.3 });\n    if (this.hp <= 0) {\n      this._dead = true;\n      this.game.vars.mothershipDestroyed = true;\n      this.game.effects.burst({ x: this.x, y: this.y, color: 0xff56de, count: 60, speed: 250, size: 7, lifetime: 1 });\n      this.game.camera.shake(0.012, 0.4);\n      this.destroy();\n    }\n  }\n  update(dt) {\n    if (!this.isClone || this._dead) return;\n    this.x = Math.max(132, this.x - 145 * dt);\n    this.y = 70 * Math.sin(this.game.time * 0.8);\n    if (this._flashUntil && this.game.time >= this._flashUntil) {\n      this.image.clearTint();\n      this._flashUntil = 0;\n    }\n    if (this.x <= 200 && this.game.time >= this._nextOrbTime) {\n      this.game.spawn('EnergyOrb', { x: this.x - 88, y: this.y, visible: true });\n      this._nextOrbTime = this.game.time + 2.2;\n    }\n  }\n}"},{"targetId":"s291i3x516535","targetName":"EnergyOrb","className":"EnergyOrb","source":"class EnergyOrb extends Sprite {\n  start() { this.hide(); }\n  onSpawn() {\n    this.show();\n    const player = this.game.find('Comet');\n    const dx = player ? player.x - this.x : -1;\n    const dy = player ? player.y - this.y : 0;\n    const length = Math.hypot(dx, dy) || 1;\n    this._vx = 115 * dx / length;\n    this._vy = 115 * dy / length;\n    try { if (this.image.postFX) this.image.postFX.addGlow(0xff55d5, 3); } catch (e) {}\n  }\n  update(dt) {\n    if (!this.isClone) return;\n    this.x += this._vx * dt;\n    this.y += this._vy * dt;\n    const player = this.game.find('Comet');\n    if (player && this.touching(player)) {\n      if (player._startDamage && player._startDamage()) {\n        player.playSound('hit');\n        this.game.camera.shake(0.006, 0.2);\n        this.game.effects.burst({ x: player.x, y: player.y, color: 0xff149f, count: 24, speed: 190, size: 5, lifetime: 0.5 });\n      }\n      this.destroy();\n      return;\n    }\n    if (this.x < -270 || this.x > 270 || this.y < -210 || this.y > 210) this.destroy();\n  }\n}","runSource":"class EnergyOrb extends Sprite {\n  start() { this.hide(); }\n  onSpawn() {\n    this.show();\n    const player = this.game.find('Comet');\n    const dx = player ? player.x - this.x : -1;\n    const dy = player ? player.y - this.y : 0;\n    const length = Math.hypot(dx, dy) || 1;\n    this._vx = 115 * dx / length;\n    this._vy = 115 * dy / length;\n    try { if (this.image.postFX) this.image.postFX.addGlow(0xff55d5, 3); } catch (e) {}\n  }\n  update(dt) {\n    if (!this.isClone) return;\n    this.x += this._vx * dt;\n    this.y += this._vy * dt;\n    const player = this.game.find('Comet');\n    if (player && this.touching(player)) {\n      if (player._startDamage && player._startDamage()) {\n        player.playSound('hit');\n        this.game.camera.shake(0.006, 0.2);\n        this.game.effects.burst({ x: player.x, y: player.y, color: 0xff149f, count: 24, speed: 190, size: 5, lifetime: 0.5 });\n      }\n      this.destroy();\n      return;\n    }\n    if (this.x < -270 || this.x > 270 || this.y < -210 || this.y > 210) this.destroy();\n  }\n}"},{"targetId":"s2g2w252x7043","targetName":"GoldenStar","className":"GoldenStar","source":"class GoldenStar extends Sprite {\n  start() { this.hide(); }\n  onSpawn() {\n    this.show();\n    try { if (this.image.postFX) this.image.postFX.addGlow(0xffdd55, 4); } catch (e) {}\n  }\n  update(dt) {\n    if (!this.isClone) return;\n    this.x -= 65 * dt;\n    this.angle += 70 * dt;\n    const player = this.game.find('Comet');\n    if (player && this.touching(player)) {\n      player.playSound('powerup');\n      this.game.stage._shockwaveAt(player.x, player.y);\n      this.destroy();\n      return;\n    }\n    if (this.x < -275) this.destroy();\n  }\n}","runSource":"class GoldenStar extends Sprite {\n  start() { this.hide(); }\n  onSpawn() {\n    this.show();\n    try { if (this.image.postFX) this.image.postFX.addGlow(0xffdd55, 4); } catch (e) {}\n  }\n  update(dt) {\n    if (!this.isClone) return;\n    this.x -= 65 * dt;\n    this.angle += 70 * dt;\n    const player = this.game.find('Comet');\n    if (player && this.touching(player)) {\n      player.playSound('powerup');\n      this.game.stage._shockwaveAt(player.x, player.y);\n      this.destroy();\n      return;\n    }\n    if (this.x < -275) this.destroy();\n  }\n}"}],"sprites":[{"id":"s4p0y0u410e0k","name":"LaserBolt","description":"A fast cyan shot that breaks the first asteroid it touches or damages the Mothership.","x":500,"y":0,"size":100,"direction":0,"visible":false,"rotationStyle":"all around"},{"id":"s084e6g4f2d5l","name":"Mothership","description":"The glowing saucer boss, arriving in wave four and shooting energy orbs.","x":500,"y":0,"size":100,"direction":0,"visible":false,"rotationStyle":"all around"},{"id":"s291i3x516535","name":"EnergyOrb","description":"A slow pink projectile aimed at the comet by the Mothership.","x":500,"y":0,"size":100,"direction":0,"visible":false,"rotationStyle":"all around"},{"id":"s2g2w252x7043","name":"GoldenStar","description":"A drifting collectible that clears on-screen asteroids with a golden shockwave.","x":500,"y":0,"size":100,"direction":0,"visible":false,"rotationStyle":"all around"}],"assets":[{"id":"a6f274v4d4d09","kind":"sound","name":"wave whoosh","dataUrl":"data:audio/wav;base64,","mime":"audio/wav","duration":0.38,"description":"A short rising retro arcade synth whoosh with a bright neon shimmer.","targetId":"t0j084r051n22","targetName":"Stage","request":"A short rising retro arcade synth whoosh with a bright neon shimmer."},{"id":"a1k4m03646w17","kind":"sound","name":"synthwave bass loop","dataUrl":"data:audio/wav;base64,","mime":"audio/wav","duration":2,"description":"A seamless, energetic synthwave arcade loop with a pulsing analog bass, crisp electronic drums and shimmering neon chords.","targetId":"t0j084r051n22","targetName":"Stage","request":"A seamless, energetic synthwave arcade loop with a pulsing analog bass, crisp electronic drums and shimmering neon chords."},{"id":"a0q636z0k5y3l","kind":"image","name":"laser bolt","dataUrl":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","mime":"image/svg+xml","width":32,"height":16,"resolution":1,"centerX":16,"centerY":8,"description":"A slender horizontal cyan laser bolt pointing right, with a brilliant white core and soft turquoise glow on a transparent background.","targetId":"s4p0y0u410e0k","targetName":"LaserBolt","request":"A slender horizontal cyan laser bolt pointing right, with a brilliant white core and soft turquoise glow on a transparent background."},{"id":"a1f4n41565z6z","kind":"image","name":"mothership","dataUrl":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","mime":"image/svg+xml","width":192,"height":112,"resolution":1,"centerX":96,"centerY":56,"description":"A huge side-view retro flying saucer with a dark purple metallic hull, broad glowing pink rim, cyan windows and a luminous magenta dome, facing left; transparent background.","targetId":"s084e6g4f2d5l","targetName":"Mothership","request":"A huge side-view retro flying saucer with a dark purple metallic hull, broad glowing pink rim, cyan windows and a luminous magenta dome, facing left; transparent background."},{"id":"a4157014r6o3z","kind":"image","name":"energy orb","dataUrl":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","mime":"image/svg+xml","width":28,"height":28,"resolution":1,"centerX":14,"centerY":14,"description":"A round hot-pink energy orb with a white center, magenta halo and tiny electric arcs, on a transparent background.","targetId":"s291i3x516535","targetName":"EnergyOrb","request":"A round hot-pink energy orb with a white center, magenta halo and tiny electric arcs, on a transparent background."},{"id":"a6m4c1t6k3n4n","kind":"image","name":"golden star","dataUrl":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","mime":"image/svg+xml","width":44,"height":44,"resolution":1,"centerX":22,"centerY":22,"description":"A bright five-point golden arcade star with a pale yellow center and a warm glowing halo, on a transparent background.","targetId":"s2g2w252x7043","targetName":"GoldenStar","request":"A bright five-point golden arcade star with a pale yellow center and a warm glowing halo, on a transparent background."}],"pieces":[{"key":"697fc02036f727af","kind":"rule","target":"Stage","block":"art style: [synthwave: deep purple space, a huge striped retro sun sinking into the horizon, a glowing pink and cyan grid racing toward it, bloom and a soft vignette on everything bright]","code":"const scene = this.game.scene;\nthis.game.background = '#170729';\nconst bg = scene.add.graphics().setScrollFactor(0).setDepth(-30);\nbg.fillGradientStyle(0x180526, 0x27083c, 0x52205e, 0x24103d, 1);\nbg.fillRect(0, 0, 480, 360);\nfor (let i = 0; i < 65; i++) {\n  bg.fillStyle(i % 3 === 0 ? 0xff75d5 : 0xbceeff, i % 4 === 0 ? 0.8 : 0.4);\n  bg.fillCircle(this.game.random(0, 480), this.game.random(0, 175), i % 9 === 0 ? 1.5 : 0.7);\n}\nconst cx = 240, cy = 172, radius = 90, horizon = 182;\nfor (let dy = -radius; dy <= radius && cy + dy < horizon; dy += 10) {\n  const half = Math.sqrt(Math.max(0, radius * radius - dy * dy));\n  const t = (dy + radius) / (2 * radius);\n  const color = (255 << 16) | (Math.round(205 - 120 * t) << 8) | Math.round(75 + 120 * t);\n  bg.fillStyle(color, 1);\n  bg.fillRect(cx - half, cy + dy, half * 2, Math.min(7, horizon - cy - dy));\n}\nbg.fillGradientStyle(0x30104d, 0x30104d, 0x0b0927, 0x0b0927, 1);\nbg.fillRect(0, horizon, 480, 360 - horizon);\nbg.lineStyle(2, 0xff4ecb, 0.9);\nbg.lineBetween(0, horizon, 480, horizon);\nconst grid = scene.add.graphics().setScrollFactor(0).setDepth(-29);\ntry {\n  const fx = this.game.camera.phaser.postFX;\n  if (fx) {\n    fx.addBloom(0xffcfff, 1, 1, 0.6, 0.55, 4);\n    fx.addVignette(0.5, 0.5, 0.8, 0.35);\n  }\n} catch (e) {}\nfor (;;) {\n  grid.clear();\n  grid.lineStyle(1, 0x00eaff, 0.6);\n  for (let x = -480; x <= 960; x += 60) grid.lineBetween(240, horizon, x, 360);\n  const phase = (this.game.time * 0.8) % 1;\n  for (let i = 0; i < 10; i++) {\n    const t = (i + phase) / 10;\n    const y = horizon + (360 - horizon) * t * t;\n    grid.lineStyle(1 + t, i % 2 ? 0xff3cbd : 0x00eaff, 0.35 + t * 0.5);\n    grid.lineBetween(0, y, 480, y);\n  }\n  yield;\n}"},{"key":"43b30c2476f14557","kind":"condition","target":"Stage","block":"[the comet has no lives left]","code":"return (this.game.vars.lives ?? 3) <= 0;"},{"key":"509930793acdb1fa","kind":"condition","target":"Stage","block":"[the Mothership has been destroyed]","code":"return this.game.vars.mothershipDestroyed === true;"},{"key":"ddc080d1c8de531c","kind":"rule","target":"Stage","block":"rule: [every 15 seconds a new wave starts: asteroids come faster and more often, and a big glowing \"WAVE 2\" (3, 4...) banner sweeps across the screen with a whoosh]","code":"const v = this.game.vars;\nv.wave ??= 1;\nfor (;;) {\n  const wave = 1 + Math.floor(this.game.time / 15);\n  if (wave > v.wave) {\n    v.wave = wave;\n    this.playSound('wave whoosh');\n    const banner = this.game.scene.add.text(-140, 110, 'WAVE ' + wave, {\n      fontFamily: 'Arial', fontSize: '42px', fontStyle: 'bold', color: '#ffffff',\n      stroke: '#ff18b9', strokeThickness: 5\n    }).setOrigin(0.5).setScrollFactor(0).setDepth(100);\n    banner.setShadow(0, 0, '#00ffff', 16, true, true);\n    this.game.scene.tweens.add({ targets: banner, x: 240, duration: 350, ease: 'Cubic.easeOut' });\n    this.game.scene.tweens.add({ targets: banner, x: 640, alpha: 0, delay: 850, duration: 400, ease: 'Cubic.easeIn', onComplete: () => banner.destroy() });\n  }\n  yield;\n}"},{"key":"1325ae4c1aa7987d","kind":"rule","target":"Stage","block":"rule: [at wave 4 the Mothership arrives from the right: a huge glowing saucer with a health bar at the top of the screen; it drifts up and down, fires slow pink energy orbs at the comet, and flashes white when the laser hits it]","code":"const scene = this.game.scene;\nconst label = scene.add.text(240, 48, 'MOTHERSHIP', {\n  fontFamily: 'Arial', fontSize: '12px', fontStyle: 'bold', color: '#ffffff'\n}).setOrigin(0.5, 0).setScrollFactor(0).setDepth(90).setVisible(false);\nlabel.setShadow(0, 0, '#ff44cc', 8, true, true);\nconst bar = scene.add.graphics().setScrollFactor(0).setDepth(90).setVisible(false);\nlet boss = null;\nfor (;;) {\n  if (!boss && (this.game.vars.wave ?? 1) >= 4 && !this.game.vars.mothershipDestroyed) {\n    boss = this.game.spawn('Mothership', { x: 350, y: 0, visible: true });\n    label.setVisible(true);\n    bar.setVisible(true);\n  }\n  if (boss && !boss._dead) {\n    const fraction = Math.max(0, boss.hp / boss.maxHp);\n    bar.clear();\n    bar.fillStyle(0x170b29, 0.9).fillRoundedRect(128, 65, 224, 13, 6);\n    bar.lineStyle(2, 0xff70e5, 1).strokeRoundedRect(128, 65, 224, 13, 6);\n    if (fraction > 0) bar.fillStyle(0xff3bbd, 1).fillRoundedRect(131, 68, 218 * fraction, 7, 3);\n  } else if (boss && boss._dead) {\n    label.setVisible(false);\n    bar.setVisible(false);\n  }\n  yield;\n}"},{"key":"6662bf9d29fdd324","kind":"rule","target":"Stage","block":"rule: [now and then a golden star drifts by; catching it sends out an expanding shockwave ring that blasts every asteroid on screen into confetti]","code":"this._shockwaveAt = (x, y) => {\n  const game = this.game;\n  game.effects.burst({ x, y, color: 0xffdf55, count: 25, speed: 180, size: 5, lifetime: 0.6 });\n  this.run(function* () {\n    const ring = game.scene.add.graphics().setDepth(40);\n    const start = game.time;\n    const maxRadius = Math.hypot(240 + Math.abs(x), 180 + Math.abs(y)) + 10;\n    while (game.time - start < 0.65) {\n      const t = Math.min(1, (game.time - start) / 0.65);\n      const r = maxRadius * t;\n      ring.clear();\n      ring.lineStyle(12, 0xffd83d, 0.2 * (1 - t)).strokeCircle(x + 240, 180 - y, r);\n      ring.lineStyle(3, 0xffffb0, 1 - t).strokeCircle(x + 240, 180 - y, r);\n      yield;\n    }\n    ring.destroy();\n  });\n  for (const rock of game.findAll('Asteroid').slice()) {\n    const r = 35 * (rock.size / 100);\n    if (rock.isClone && rock.visible && rock.x + r >= -240 && rock.x - r <= 240 && rock.y + r >= -180 && rock.y - r <= 180) {\n      this._blastAsteroid(rock, 'confetti');\n    }\n  }\n};\nyield* this.wait(10);\nfor (;;) {\n  this.game.spawn('GoldenStar', { x: 275, y: this.game.random(-130, 130), visible: true });\n  yield* this.wait(this.game.random(17, 24));\n}"},{"key":"70ae5d5572f47094","kind":"rule","target":"Stage","block":"rule: [the score is the seconds survived plus 50 for every asteroid blasted, shown big and glowing at the top center, with a combo multiplier that grows when you blast asteroids quickly one after another]","code":"const game = this.game, v = game.vars, scene = game.scene;\nv.blastScore ??= 0;\nv.asteroidsBlasted ??= 0;\nv.combo ??= 0;\nv.lastBlastAt ??= -1000;\nthis._blastAsteroid = (rock, style = 'rubble') => {\n  if (!rock || !rock.isClone || !rock.visible || rock._blasted) return;\n  rock._blasted = true;\n  v.combo = game.time - v.lastBlastAt <= 2 ? Math.min(8, v.combo + 1) : 1;\n  v.lastBlastAt = game.time;\n  v.asteroidsBlasted++;\n  v.blastScore += 50 * v.combo;\n  const x = rock.x, y = rock.y;\n  game.effects.burst({ x, y, color: style === 'confetti' ? 0xffdc55 : 0xc13aff, count: 15, speed: 160, size: 4, lifetime: 0.5 });\n  const colors = style === 'confetti' ? [0xffdd44, 0xff54c8, 0x44eeff, 0xc55aff] : [0x8731c9, 0xc65aff, 0xff5aca];\n  for (let i = 0; i < 8; i++) {\n    const bit = scene.add.rectangle(x + 240, 180 - y, game.random(3, 8), game.random(3, 8), colors[i % colors.length]).setDepth(25);\n    scene.tweens.add({ targets: bit, x: bit.x + game.random(-100, 100), y: bit.y + game.random(-100, 80), angle: game.random(-220, 220), alpha: 0, duration: game.random(400, 700), onComplete: () => bit.destroy() });\n  }\n  rock.destroy();\n};\nconst score = scene.add.text(240, 8, '', { fontFamily: 'Arial', fontSize: '23px', fontStyle: 'bold', color: '#ffffff', stroke: '#6b1a9c', strokeThickness: 3 }).setOrigin(0.5, 0).setScrollFactor(0).setDepth(90);\nscore.setShadow(0, 0, '#00ffff', 12, true, true);\nconst combo = scene.add.text(240, 34, '', { fontFamily: 'Arial', fontSize: '14px', fontStyle: 'bold', color: '#ff75e6' }).setOrigin(0.5, 0).setScrollFactor(0).setDepth(90);\ncombo.setShadow(0, 0, '#ff00cc', 8, true, true);\nfor (;;) {\n  if (game.time - v.lastBlastAt > 2) v.combo = 0;\n  v.score = Math.floor(game.time) + v.blastScore;\n  score.setText('SCORE ' + v.score);\n  combo.setText(v.combo > 1 ? 'COMBO x' + v.combo : '');\n  yield;\n}"},{"key":"e7416d361e5575d1","kind":"rule","target":"Stage","block":"rule: [a pulsing synthwave bass loop plays as music the whole game]","code":"this.game.music('synthwave bass loop');"},{"key":"eff8919a44982dd9","kind":"behavior","target":"Comet","block":"always: [glide smoothly toward the mouse, tilting the way I move, with a long glowing cyan trail of sparkles behind me]","code":"try {\n  if (this.image.postFX) this.image.postFX.addGlow(0x40f8ff, 3);\n} catch (e) {}\nthis.game.scene.add.particles(0, 0, 'amble-dot', {\n  follow: this.image, frequency: 25, lifespan: { min: 600, max: 1000 },\n  speedX: { min: -100, max: -35 }, speedY: { min: -22, max: 22 },\n  scale: { start: 0.35, end: 0 }, alpha: { start: 0.85, end: 0 },\n  tint: [0x44ffff, 0x88ddff, 0xffffff], blendMode: 'ADD'\n}).setDepth((this.layer ?? 0) - 0.1);\nfor (;;) {\n  const mouse = this.game.input.mouse;\n  const tx = Math.max(-208, Math.min(208, mouse.x));\n  const ty = Math.max(-160, Math.min(160, mouse.y));\n  const dx = tx - this.x, dy = ty - this.y;\n  const amount = 1 - Math.exp(-7 * this.game.dt);\n  this.x += dx * amount;\n  this.y += dy * amount;\n  const tilt = Math.hypot(dx, dy) < 1 ? 0 : Math.max(-35, Math.min(35, Math.atan2(dy, Math.max(40, Math.abs(dx))) * 180 / Math.PI));\n  this.angle += (tilt - this.angle) * (1 - Math.exp(-10 * this.game.dt));\n  yield;\n}"},{"key":"4ad4138e36dd55a3","kind":"rule","target":"Comet","block":"rule: [the comet has 3 lives, shown as little glowing hearts at the top right]","code":"const v = this.game.vars;\nv.lives ??= 3;\nthis._invulnerableUntil ??= 0;\nthis._startDamage = () => {\n  if (this.game.time < this._invulnerableUntil || (v.lives ?? 3) <= 0) return false;\n  this._invulnerableUntil = this.game.time + 1;\n  v.lives = Math.max(0, (v.lives ?? 3) - 1);\n  return true;\n};\nconst hearts = this.game.scene.add.text(470, 10, '', {\n  fontFamily: 'Arial', fontSize: '22px', fontStyle: 'bold', color: '#ff70ca'\n}).setOrigin(1, 0).setScrollFactor(0).setDepth(90);\nhearts.setShadow(0, 0, '#ff149f', 10, true, true);\nfor (;;) {\n  hearts.setText('♥ '.repeat(Math.max(0, v.lives)).trim());\n  this.opacity = this.game.time < this._invulnerableUntil && Math.floor(this.game.time * 12) % 2 === 0 ? 0.22 : 1;\n  yield;\n}"},{"key":"a87452cc429df18f","kind":"behavior","target":"Comet","block":"never: [leave the screen]","code":"for (;;) {\n  this.keepOnStage();\n  yield;\n}"},{"key":"50cb85e2ec8441fb","kind":"action","target":"Comet","block":"do [fire a bright cyan laser bolt straight ahead that shatters the first asteroid it hits into glowing purple rubble]","code":"const a = this.angle * Math.PI / 180;\nthis.game.spawn('LaserBolt', {\n  x: this.x + 30 * Math.cos(a), y: this.y + 30 * Math.sin(a),\n  angle: this.angle, visible: true\n});"},{"key":"5f1e3480946383cd","kind":"condition","target":"Comet","block":"[I'm not blinking]","code":"return this.game.time >= (this._invulnerableUntil ?? 0);"},{"key":"a48bfe633bbdfc62","kind":"action","target":"Comet","block":"particles: [a burst of hot pink sparks]","code":"this.game.effects.burst({ x: this.x, y: this.y, color: 0xff149f, count: 24, speed: 190, size: 5, lifetime: 0.5 });"},{"key":"9faed7583a63b43d","kind":"action","target":"Comet","block":"do [lose a life, then blink for 1 second (asteroids can't hurt me while I blink)]","code":"if (!this._startDamage()) return;\nyield* this.wait(1);"},{"key":"20f2bfbd50024ca8","kind":"value","target":"Asteroid","block":"[a little less time each wave, starting at 1 second]","code":"return Math.max(0.28, 1 - 0.12 * ((this.game.vars.wave ?? 1) - 1));"},{"key":"f3cdb5855f4f35d2","kind":"action","target":"Asteroid","block":"do [start just past the right edge at a random height, with a random size and spin]","code":"this.size = this.game.random(65, 125);\nthis.setPosition(248 + 35 * this.size / 100, this.game.random(-150, 150));\nthis.angle = this.game.random(0, 359);\nthis._spinSpeed = this.game.random(-160, 160);\nif (Math.abs(this._spinSpeed) < 35) this._spinSpeed = 60;"},{"key":"5db7e1d1f61f2922","kind":"condition","target":"Asteroid","block":"[I'm past the left edge]","code":"return this.x < -240 - 35 * this.size / 100;"},{"key":"b88fd2939418c5d8","kind":"action","target":"Asteroid","block":"do [drift left at this wave's speed, spinning]","code":"const speed = Math.min(300, 115 + 35 * ((this.game.vars.wave ?? 1) - 1));\nthis.x -= speed * this.game.dt;\nthis.angle += (this._spinSpeed ?? 60) * this.game.dt;"}],"brief":"game: [steer a tiny comet through a neon asteroid storm, blast your way through the waves, then defeat the Mothership]\nmade for: [anyone who likes flashy arcade games]\nart style: [synthwave: deep purple space, a huge striped retro sun sinking into the horizon, a glowing pink and cyan grid racing toward it, bloom and a soft vignette on everything bright]","style":"art style: [synthwave: deep purple space, a huge striped retro sun sinking into the horizon, a glowing pink and cyan grid racing toward it, bloom and a soft vignette on everything bright]","revised":[],"questions":[],"issues":[]}}